<section vertical-align="center">
  <grid spacing="medium">
    <grid-item colspan="21" vertical-align="center">
      <labels><label variant="solid">Interpretive claim</label></labels>
      <h2>Realism: a social world closes in</h2>
      <p>The poem’s realistic value lies in exposing a system, not merely describing individual misfortune.</p>
      <p>Actors change across Kiều’s reversals; unequal rules and recurring forms of coercion remain.</p>
    </grid-item>
    <grid-item colspan="39" vertical-align="center" align="center">
      <diagram template-key="inputs" width="560pt" height="350pt" align="center" data-meta='{"general":[{"text":"<h4>Structural injustice</h4>"}],"step":[{"text":"<h4>Money</h4><p>Family crisis becomes a market for Kiều’s body.</p>"},{"text":"<h4>Official language</h4><p>Coercion and betrayal appear as procedure.</p>"},{"text":"<h4>Gendered judgment</h4><p>Female reputation is policed more harshly than male power.</p>"},{"text":"<h4>Repeated reversals</h4><p>Injustice recurs across changing actors.</p>"}]}'></diagram>
    </grid-item>
  </grid>
</section>